menu "Hackulator"

    config HACKU_FORCE_CASTER
        bool "Force caster mode (skip TFT, for headless testing)"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, the TFT is never probed and the device boots
            straight into caster mode: framebuffer is streamed over
            UART0 @ 1 Mbaud (PKC protocol) and keys come from the host
            viewer. Useful when a screen is attached but you want to
            test through the viewer anyway.

endmenu
